# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Debug-info of release crash reports
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# R8 shrinking + optimisation is ON for release (see build.gradle.kts), but the
# app must still emit stack traces with the real class name, method name and
# source line of every frame. Obfuscation renames classes/methods, which turns
#   at dev.woms.mumdroid.core.net.MumbleClient.connect(MumbleClient.kt:120)
# into
#   at a.b.c(SourceFile:12)
# and that can only be undone with the ProGuard mapping file. Turning
# obfuscation off keeps the original identifiers while still allowing shrinking
# (unused code removal) and optimisation.
-dontobfuscate

# Keep the source-line metadata. Without LineNumberTable a frame shows no line
# at all; without SourceFile it shows "Unknown Source".
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
-keepattributes EnclosingMethod,InnerClasses,Signature,Exceptions

# Never rewrite the SourceFile value; we want the real ".kt" name in the trace.
-renamesourcefileattribute SourceFile
